(7320086, 1141957, 156466, '<td valign="top">I would crop this tighter at the top and go with straight B&amp;W or a more subtle set of tones.  This is "bruised".</td>', 'I would crop this tighter at the top and go with straight B&W or a more subtle set of tones.  This is "bruised".', '2015-02-22 17:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7320087, 1142163, 156466, '<td valign="top">I love staring at this, but I don''t love how it feels like I''m staring thru blown out highlights in the upper left corner.  After 5 minutes I''m still not sure what it is and want to stare at it more.  But I can''t give it the score I want to.</td>', 'I love staring at this, but I don''t love how it feels like I''m staring thru blown out highlights in the upper left corner.  After 5 minutes I''m still not sure what it is and want to stare at it more.  But I can''t give it the score I want to.', '2015-02-22 17:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7320088, 1141937, 156466, '<td valign="top">Would love the white a LITTLE more white, but still one of my favorites so far.</td>', 'Would love the white a LITTLE more white, but still one of my favorites so far.', '2015-02-22 17:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7320089, 1142204, 156466, '<td valign="top">Looks like some golf courses I''ve played on.</td>', 'Looks like some golf courses I''ve played on.', '2015-02-22 17:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
