(7320091, 1141946, 156466, '<td valign="top">I love the shot and everything about it ... except the greenish tone.  I don''t know where''d I''d go, but I know I wouldn''t have gone here.  So beautiful, but it''s off-putting to me.  I''ll still drop you a 6 that, as Jimi implied, could have been 9.</td>', 'I love the shot and everything about it ... except the greenish tone.  I don''t know where''d I''d go, but I know I wouldn''t have gone here.  So beautiful, but it''s off-putting to me.  I''ll still drop you a 6 that, as Jimi implied, could have been 9.', '2015-02-22 17:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7320092, 1141907, 156466, '<td valign="top">Really nice, but I''d like to have had the whites a little closer to white</td>', 'Really nice, but I''d like to have had the whites a little closer to white', '2015-02-22 17:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7320094, 1142114, 156466, '<td valign="top">9. My nits to pick involve a bit of upright perspective correction, and knowing I''d love this as a pure B&amp;W.  But with that said, I''ve taken off more for less, so it tells you how much I really like this.</td>', '9. My nits to pick involve a bit of upright perspective correction, and knowing I''d love this as a pure B&W.  But with that said, I''ve taken off more for less, so it tells you how much I really like this.', '2015-02-22 17:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7320095, 1141620, 156466, '<td valign="top">Great use of reflection.</td>', 'Great use of reflection.', '2015-02-22 17:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7320096, 1142183, 156466, '<td valign="top">Great possibility in these lines.  I don''t see them realized here.</td>', 'Great possibility in these lines.  I don''t see them realized here.', '2015-02-22 17:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7320098, 1142132, 156466, '<td valign="top">From the guy who always goes to "glow" to see what it looks like, I''d love to see less of it here.  I like this so much, but want to see 3 or 4 other treatments of it. 7</td>', 'From the guy who always goes to "glow" to see what it looks like, I''d love to see less of it here.  I like this so much, but want to see 3 or 4 other treatments of it. 7', '2015-02-22 17:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
